      "template": "Hi,\n\nThe display has a power-off memory function. If it shows 0% after a power cut and reconnect, two causes are possible:\n1. The memory function has an extremely low probability of not saving under certain conditions — a rare, occasional event.\n2. A zero-capacity voltage is set, and the battery sat long enough for voltage to drop below it, triggering the auto-zero function.\n\nPlease have the customer re-calibrate the capacity.\n\nBest regards,\nLitime",
