      "issue": "Waterproof charger surface runs hot",
      "summary": "Normal — sealed, fanless, self-cooling design; compliant and safe.",
      "template": "Hi,\n\nWaterproof chargers need high airtightness and have no internal fan, relying on self-cooling. The shell runs hotter than other models, but this complies with our safety standards and is safe — please use with confidence.\n\nBest regards,\nLitime",
