      "template": "Hi,\n\nUnder normal use, charger noise comes mainly from the cooling fan, which protects internal components. Without it, temperatures could rise to unsafe levels. Fan speed prioritizes safety, so the noise (typically ~60dB) is normal.\n\nIf the fan noise has affected your usage, let us know about a return for refund or exchange.\n\nBest regards,\nLitime",
